      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I arrived to this clinic in a lot of stress after I was rushed in the hospital to do MRI. They were so helpful and agreed to do it immediately and accommodated with getting my description from radiologist fast. The person conducting the MRI spoke perfect english and acted very professional and kind. I was taken care of and safe. Thank you so much! I recommend this place.",
